---
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';
import InteractiveArchitecture from '../InteractiveArchitecture.svelte';
import DrawnLine from '../motion/DrawnLine.astro';
const tool = projects[0]!; const monolith = projects[1]!; const site = projects[2]!;
---
<section id="work" class="projects-scene" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="shell work-intro"><h2 id="work-title">Open it.<br />See how it works.</h2><p>Three public projects. Different surfaces.<br />The interesting bits are underneath.</p></div>
  <article class="project-world tool-world"><div class="shell"><div class="project-heading"><h3><a href="/work/vs-notrack/">vs-notrack</a></h3><p>{tool.role}<br />{tool.kind}</p></div><div class="project-body"><div class="project-story"><p class="project-deck">Your editor.<br />Your switches.</p><p>{tool.summary}</p><ul class="tags">{tool.technologies.map(t => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul><a class="primary-link light" href="/work/vs-notrack/">Inspect the decisions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="project-state">Source study. System-modifying scripts, not a privacy promise.</p></div><InteractiveArchitecture client:visible /></div></div></article>
  <article class="project-world monolith-world"><div class="shell"><div class="project-heading"><h3><a href="/work/monolith/">Monolith</a></h3><p>Project by fraa2a<br />My role: contributor</p></div><div class="project-body"><div class="signal-diagram" aria-label="Simplified Monolith control relationships"><p class="diagram-label">Source diagram / control side</p><div class="diagram-ui">Desktop UI</div><div class="diagram-wire" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="diagram-rpc">Local RPC<DrawnLine circle /></div><div class="diagram-wire" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="diagram-recorder">Native recorder</div><p>Controls talk. The recorder records.</p></div><div class="project-story"><p class="project-deck">Behind one button,<br />a whole conversation.</p><p>{monolith.summary}</p><ul class="tags">{monolith.technologies.map(t => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul><a class="primary-link" href="/work/monolith/">Follow my contributions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="project-state">Current Tauri / Preact architecture. Historical WinUI / C# changes are identified in the case study.</p></div></div></div></article>
  <article class="project-world site-world"><div class="shell site-composition"><div><h3><a href="/work/portfolio/">This thing<br />you’re touching.</a></h3><p>{site.summary}</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/portfolio/">Take the portfolio apart</a></div><div class="site-recipe"><code>index.astro</code><span>Content first.</span><code>Workspace.svelte</code><span>Play where it matters.</span><code>bun run build</code><span>Static on the other side.</span></div></div></article>
</section>
